  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  punks:
  - Huh!
  - Noobs...
  - Behind you!
  - I see....I see...you failing your test
  - A hell naw!
  - You Fayliure!
  - Disappointment!
  - Emotional Damage!
  - Stop it get Some help.
  - Use your Dashes wisely
  - ...................
  - ran out of stamina?
  - i see...goofyness deep inside u
  - 'Pro Tip : let your intrusive thoughts win'
  - You are so fat that even earth's rotation slowed down
  - you are so ugly that even ur reflection wants to puke
  - you are the type person that puts sugar under your pillow to get sweet dreams
  - u are the type of person who wears sunglasses indoors bcz "the future is bright"
  - u are so fat that thanos snap only incinirated a quarter of your fatness
  - jolly good!
  - excuse plz!
  - nice to-met-yo
  - nver gonna give you up never gonna let you down
  - roses r red violets r blue , education system is broken and so r u
  - roses r red violets r blue , jirayia died single and so will you
  - roses r red violets r blue, let alone her, even corona avoided u
  - burn!!!!!
  - offended?
  - r u (what evers your name) king of losers
  - by the rules of the street i own you
  punkText: {fileID: 3333698997821244874}
